  {
   "id": "unsafe-express-173282@major-2024-04-09",
   "gameId": "unsafe-express-173282",
   "displayName": "Update news and things to come.",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-04-09T10:23:26.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have been hard at work on Unsafe and as we get closer to our goal, we wanted to give you an update and a rough outline of things to come.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This new content we are working on will be released as an update/overhall to the game and will contain multiple new enemies, a lot more tools, procedural map generation and some meta-game. Our goal is to create a solid base of a game, on which we will be able to keep adding content.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We expect to run a beta test in the next couple of months, so that we can get your feedback and make sure the game is as bug free as possible. We then expect to take some time to fix any issues that arise and release the update as soon as those are resolved. From there, our work on Unsafe will be focused on bringing more content in the form of even more enemies, tools and map variations.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Keep an eye out for the beta announcement!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
