  {
   "id": "unsafe-express-173282@major-2022-06-17",
   "gameId": "unsafe-express-173282",
   "displayName": "Update Notes 17/06",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-06-17T17:08:18.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone! With the new update, we are received a lot of feedback and ideas, thank you all! With that in mind, we are working on some finishing touches as well as bug fixing and just pushed a patch. Some of the changes this time are quite significant, especially for solo players, here's a list of some of them:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Self-revive for Solo players! Holding a revive cell will now give you a second (or third) chance!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue that caused an alert beeping sound to loop infinitely",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Other minor balance changes for Solo play",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Further powerpad buffs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "UI updates and fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Other quality of life & bug fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There's more to come, so keep an eye out! New translations are also being worked on, we'll have news soon! Again, thank you for your feedback and have fun!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "OnSkull Games",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
