  {
   "id": "unsafe-express-173282@major-2021-11-23",
   "gameId": "unsafe-express-173282",
   "displayName": "Update Notes 23/11",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-11-23T17:35:55.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone! It's been a few days and we have been hard at work! We just pushed a big update, fixing a lot of issues and adding some quality of life improvements! Here's a list:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated mission logs to better explain what needs to be done!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The suit's Pulse now charges with mouse 2 and fires with mouse 1. This means that the pulse can be canceled anytime!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "The enemy can now change targets, so no following it people!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved sound occlusion and sounds in general!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "VoiP now has push to talk",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some problems with minigames",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Minigame explanations in \"help\" menu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where items would stay highlighted when picked up",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an error that sometimes caused players to stay stuck on the enemy",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some item drop points in utility rooms",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an error that caused some sounds to never stop playing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some objectives on the map, to make what you need to do clearer.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Lot's of other minor fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for all the reports and your understanding, especially in our discord server! More fixes will be rolled out frequently!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "OnSkull Games",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
